(7643278, 1241636, 30049, '<td valign="top">Surprised to see this not break the Top 10.  FWIW I really enjoyed it and it was tied for 2nd place with my selections (gave it an 8).  I love the color and the silhouette of the intriquing.  Only nit, in hindsight after seeing it again now, is the foreground seems muttled and more brown than black.  Nonetheless - well seen and captured.</td>', 'Surprised to see this not break the Top 10.  FWIW I really enjoyed it and it was tied for 2nd place with my selections (gave it an 8).  I love the color and the silhouette of the intriquing.  Only nit, in hindsight after seeing it again now, is the foreground seems muttled and more brown than black.  Nonetheless - well seen and captured.', '2019-10-08 07:47:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7643279, 1241547, 30049, '<td valign="top">47th?  For real?  Hmmm.  Well, I had this picked near the top (tied for 2nd - gave it an 8).  The guys smile is so charming, and I like the tension of the composition.  Well, I guess I do have one nit that I overlooked when taking time to really study it beyond the person ... and that is the framing; some may have thought the overhanging piece of the building (above the gentleman) was distracting.  Maybe a little tighter crop?  Who knows.  Anyways - on first viewing I liked it (still do!).  :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-10-08 06:52:59.</i></td>', '47th?  For real?  Hmmm.  Well, I had this picked near the top (tied for 2nd - gave it an 8).  The guys smile is so charming, and I like the tension of the composition.  Well, I guess I do have one nit that I overlooked when taking time to really study it beyond the person ... and that is the framing; some may have thought the overhanging piece of the building (above the gentleman) was distracting.  Maybe a little tighter crop?  Who knows.  Anyways - on first viewing I liked it (still do!).  :-)', '2019-10-08 07:50:13.000000', '2019-10-08 07:52:59.000000', 0),
(7643282, 1241518, 53200, '<td valign="top">Once again - a fabulous shot - congratulations Dee!!!</td>', 'Once again - a fabulous shot - congratulations Dee!!!', '2019-10-08 08:18:07.000000', NULL, 0),
