ires him (Usually during freestudies). He has one foot in the stone age, one foot in the modern day and quite the ego. If Grog is inspired to leave one of his great comments, you''ve received a vote of at least 8 from him. Start at the beginning:The Chronicles of Grog  Grog:', '2019-10-12 01:09:51.000000', '2019-10-12 01:10:24.000000', 0),
